  "reason": "RNA-only multiprofile scvi_n200 with avgpool is the current best configuration (0.650 accuracy, 0.628 F1), while image-only ResNet50 is weak (0.208 accuracy). The key uncertainty is whether image features provide complementary signal to the strong RNA pipeline. config_030 keeps the best RNA encoder, multiprofile setting, and avgpool aggregation, adds ResNet50, and uses a simple concat fusion, directly testing the value of multimodal fusion with minimal added complexity. If it improves over the RNA-only baseline, multimodal modeling is promising; if not, it supports focusing on RNA-only designs."
